## Not yet checked in the game {% #live-check %}

Every request the plugin sends comes from another bot's capture of the event, not from our own. Before you trust it on your main account, check these on a spare account with **Log only** off:

- The camp is joined and each kind of building, expansion and port goes through.
- The coin fee for sending troops and tools matches what the game takes.
- The game opens the next level by itself after a level is closed.
